T-003 REQ-002 pattern ANCHOR regression -- RED (mutation) verification log
=========================================================================

Purpose
-------
Proof that the anchor-regression checks appended to
tests/sdd-domain/contract-v2-schema.Tests.ps1 actually KILL the mutation they
were written to catch. A test that cannot fail closes nothing.

The behaviour under protection: the three REQ-002 patterns are COMPILED with
\A ... \Z (.sh, Python) and \A ... \z (.ps1, .NET) rather than ^ ... $.
contracts/domain-contract.v2.schema.json declares those patterns for JSON
Schema draft-07, whose `pattern` keyword is ECMA-262 WITHOUT the multiline
flag -- there `$` matches END OF INPUT only, so the schema REJECTS "Order\n"
as a concepts[].name. Python's `$` and .NET's `$` both ALSO match immediately
before a final newline, so a twin re-anchored ^ ... $ would ACCEPT a value the
schema it implements rejects.

Before this change that behaviour had ZERO regression protection: reverting
either twin's anchors left the full 269-check suite at 269 passed / 0 failed,
because no fixture anywhere carried a trailing-newline value.

Method
------
The real repository was never mutated. The working tree (excluding mcp/) was
copied to a scratch directory and both mutations were applied and reverted
only inside that copy. Both twins in the real repository are byte-unchanged:

  4613aacd33ed9c30956f218374a300503e25ddfa936e478759ca2a1253e152e4  plugins/sdd-domain/scripts/validate-domain-contract.sh
  8410894d3d4dd26b0d46b99e60e4de1e96bfa733c14949c503cb9be2c75a9eac  plugins/sdd-domain/scripts/validate-domain-contract.ps1

Toolchain: pwsh 7.6.2, Pester 4.10.1, macOS (darwin 25.5.0).
Command:  pwsh -NoProfile -Command 'Import-Module Pester -RequiredVersion 4.10.1; Invoke-Pester -Script "tests/sdd-domain/contract-v2-schema.Tests.ps1"'

Windows PowerShell 5.1 could NOT be exercised here (this host is macOS); the
5.1 leg of the .ps1 twin is unverified by these runs.

Reference points
----------------
  pristine tree, before this change      269 passed /  0 failed / 0 skipped
  pristine tree, after  this change      287 passed /  0 failed / 0 skipped   (+18 new checks)


