Representative failure detail (the mutated .sh twin ACCEPTS the value):

  [-] sh twin rejects a trailing newline in concepts[0].name -- FAILS if \A ... \Z is reverted to ^ ... $ [SKIPPED when bash/python3 is absent from PATH] 58ms
